      "mergeID": "6850379247936b923a570c9c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Overall performance rank in the performance breakdown section is displayed incorrectly compared to the website, shown on the nameplate and SDK.\n\nThe avatar's performance rank is judged to be Medium by the server-side checking, so the display elsewhere is correct.\n\nAlso, I checked the JSON file, and I found the old data for Unity 2019, which seems to have been judged as poor. I guess that the performance display in the issue refers to that data.",
